From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:57:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] es_input: XiFan RF35H gamepad, with Select as hotkey

The RF35H has no function key: besides the D-pad, ABXY, the shoulders,
Select, Start and the stick clicks there are only power and reset. Its
device tree still declares a phantom BTN_MODE to keep the numbering of
the other retrogame joypads, so the mapping is that of retrogame_joypad
with the hotkey on Select, as on odroidgo2_v11_joypad.

GUID: bus 0x19, vendor 0x484B, product 0x1135, version 0x0100, from the
joypad-* properties of rk3326-xifan-rf35h.dts.

Signed-off-by: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019W6m4A3E7pevQ1bs91jPmM
---
 .../controllers/es_input.cfg                  | 23 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)

